      "statement": "`scopeForCode` lowercases both sides and returns `null` unless the code matches a membership; a `TenantScope` is only built from `profile.tenants`, which is RLS-scoped, so the downstream `tenant_id = scope.tenantId` filter selects among schools RLS already allows rather than granting.",
