      "id": "claim_65cc176d0e464ffb9e97097d2e2dd165",
      "statement": "`resolveRouteRole` prefers the unauthenticated `?role=` override ahead of the trusted role, so it is a presentation signal: any caller can set it and a real trainer adding `?role=admin` would skip an office-only redirect.",
